sc-B1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M = (carry (dims (fst Δ1)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-cm1D Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-sb1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (snd (snd σ)) (sc-cmd1M Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))
sc-A2 : (Δ2 Δ1 Δ : CCtx) (w2 : World Δ2 Δ1) (σ : Sub Δ1 Δ) (Z : Type 1) (M : Mean Δ Z) → (DCube (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ))
sc-A2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M = (cmap-d (fst Δ2) (fst Δ1) (cmap-of (fst Δ2) (fst Δ1) (fst w2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-sb1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-B1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))
sc-E3 : (Δ2 Δ1 Δ : CCtx) (w2 : World Δ2 Δ1) (σ : Sub Δ1 Δ) (Z : Type 1) (M : Mean Δ Z) → (DCube (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ))
sc-E3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M = (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))
sc-E4 : (Δ2 Δ1 Δ : CCtx) (w2 : World Δ2 Δ1) (σ : Sub Δ1 Δ) (Z : Type 1) (M : Mean Δ Z) → (DCube (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ))
sc-E4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M = (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-E3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))
-- (2026-11-12, (5); F1 generalized from a world to a substitution σ before the world w2, with ρ the
-- composite's dimension part and q, qd the base and dependent paths from w2's dimension part after
-- σ's to ρ's) carrying along sub-after's base path is carrying along each piece (sc-carry: carry-pcat
-- at each joint, qd by carry-uniq at the first, carry-nat at the second); then subM-after: the
-- composite's action is the two actions, by sc-carry, pull-pull (map-pull's piece), pull-move (w2's
-- path with its carried vertex substitutions) and cmap-d-pull (cmap-dmap's piece)
