  pcat (DCube (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x0 Δ2 Δ ρ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-WP Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ ρ q) (sc-A Δ2 Δ ρ Z M)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x0 Δ2 Δ ρ) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ ρ q) (sc-A Δ2 Δ ρ Z M))) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-E4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M)) (carry-pcat (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x0 Δ2 Δ ρ) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ ρ q) (sc-R1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A Δ2 Δ ρ Z M))
  (pcat (DCube (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x0 Δ2 Δ ρ) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ ρ q) (sc-A Δ2 Δ ρ Z M))) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-E4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))
     (λ i → carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ)
        (carry-uniq (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x0 Δ2 Δ ρ) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ ρ q) (sc-A Δ2 Δ ρ Z M) (sc-A1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M) (λ j → qd (~ j)) i))
  (pcat (DCube (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-E4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M)) (carry-pcat (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))
  (pcat (DCube (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-E4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))
     (λ i → carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ)
        (carry-nat (dims (fst Δ1)) (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (λ c → cmap-cube (fst Δ2) (fst Δ1) (cmap-of (fst Δ2) (fst Δ1) (fst w2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) c) (λ c d → cmap-d (fst Δ2) (fst Δ1) (cmap-of (fst Δ2) (fst Δ1) (fst w2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) c d) (sc-cm1D Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-sb1 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (snd (snd σ)) (sc-cmd1M Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M) i))
  (pcat (DCube (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-E3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M)) (carry (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-E4 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M)) (carry-pcat (dims (fst Δ2)) (CtxV (fst Δ)) (FbE (fst Δ) Z) (sc-x2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-x5 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-Q3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-R3 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ) (sc-A2 Δ2 Δ1 Δ w2 σ Z M))
